  "account": "破局书屋",
  "source_title": "当你学会高情商说话技巧，你的路会越走越宽。#高情商#说话技巧",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 124.318005,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "怎么你这一入职，我刚种的花就死了，花开富贵嘛，花开过了就剩富贵了。看来领导您啊要发大财了。小李啊，我看你穿衣品味不错嘛，思想上领导的高度我望尘莫及，只能在衣品上找些自我安慰了。来就来带什么礼物啊，都不是外人。领导，您都说了，不是外人，我一直都把您当长辈看，哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理啊。年轻轻就是好啊，年轻就是还不够沉稳，还要向您多学习，我们才能变得更优秀。来，这么晚只能吃剩菜了吧。领导饭在哪儿我都能吃，但您这桌不是谁想做就能做的，能赶上已经是我的运气了，打这么多饭，你喂猪呢？领导，我哪敢啊，我还以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，都说宰相肚里能撑船，更何况只是一碗饭呢。小李最近表现不错啊，我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，我得提前敬一杯。听这意思，领导是要高升了呀，我得提前敬领导一杯。哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哎，你什么意思啊？怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。领导美满美满，代表幸福美满，这一辈子美满就是一辈子美满啊。哈哈哈哈哎，我这肚子喝茶都能胖，领导你那不叫胖，那叫宰相肚里能撑船，装的全是大事儿。哈哈哈，你酒量挺好的呀。领导，您可抬举我了，我平时真不太能喝，这不今天和您在一起吃饭，高兴啊，这一高兴就多贪了几杯。这藕是好藕啊，就是心眼儿太多了。领导哦虽然心眼多，但也是您的下酒菜啊。哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，这鸭子是好鸭子，就是嘴硬，嘴硬，才守得住秘密关注我，每天学点高情商，说话技巧，让你的路越走越宽。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00001",
      "start_ms": 210,
      "end_ms": 1290,
      "text": "怎么你这一入职，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1530,
      "end_ms": 3090,
      "text": "我刚种的花就死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3170,
      "end_ms": 4170,
      "text": "花开富贵嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4250,
      "end_ms": 5850,
      "text": "花开过了就剩富贵了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00005",
      "start_ms": 5890,
      "end_ms": 7570,
      "text": "看来领导您啊要发大财了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00006",
      "start_ms": 9570,
      "end_ms": 10210,
      "text": "小李啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00007",
      "start_ms": 10930,
      "end_ms": 12610,
      "text": "我看你穿衣品味不错嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00008",
      "start_ms": 13230,
      "end_ms": 15350,
      "text": "思想上领导的高度我望尘莫及，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00009",
      "start_ms": 15690,
      "end_ms": 17570,
      "text": "只能在衣品上找些自我安慰了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00010",
      "start_ms": 19470,
      "end_ms": 21290,
      "text": "来就来带什么礼物啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00011",
      "start_ms": 21290,
      "end_ms": 22130,
      "text": "都不是外人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00012",
      "start_ms": 22310,
      "end_ms": 22730,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00013",
      "start_ms": 22990,
      "end_ms": 23630,
      "text": "您都说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00014",
      "start_ms": 23630,
      "end_ms": 24270,
      "text": "不是外人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00015",
      "start_ms": 24330,
      "end_ms": 25890,
      "text": "我一直都把您当长辈看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00016",
      "start_ms": 25970,
      "end_ms": 27950,
      "text": "哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00017",
      "start_ms": 27950,
      "end_ms": 31020,
      "text": "年轻轻就是好啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00018",
      "start_ms": 31680,
      "end_ms": 33340,
      "text": "年轻就是还不够沉稳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00019",
      "start_ms": 33760,
      "end_ms": 35020,
      "text": "还要向您多学习，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00020",
      "start_ms": 35280,
      "end_ms": 36760,
      "text": "我们才能变得更优秀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00021",
      "start_ms": 40400,
      "end_ms": 40620,
      "text": "来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00022",
      "start_ms": 40620,
      "end_ms": 42460,
      "text": "这么晚只能吃剩菜了吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00023",
      "start_ms": 43120,
      "end_ms": 45160,
      "text": "领导饭在哪儿我都能吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00024",
      "start_ms": 45480,
      "end_ms": 47680,
      "text": "但您这桌不是谁想做就能做的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00025",
      "start_ms": 47820,
      "end_ms": 49400,
      "text": "能赶上已经是我的运气了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00026",
      "start_ms": 49400,
      "end_ms": 50120,
      "text": "打这么多饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00027",
      "start_ms": 50120,
      "end_ms": 50780,
      "text": "你喂猪呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00028",
      "start_ms": 50960,
      "end_ms": 51380,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00029",
      "start_ms": 51520,
      "end_ms": 52340,
      "text": "我哪敢啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00030",
      "start_ms": 52420,
      "end_ms": 54520,
      "text": "我还以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00031",
      "start_ms": 54520,
      "end_ms": 55980,
      "text": "都说宰相肚里能撑船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00032",
      "start_ms": 56180,
      "end_ms": 57480,
      "text": "更何况只是一碗饭呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00033",
      "start_ms": 59360,
      "end_ms": 60950,
      "text": "小李最近表现不错啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00034",
      "start_ms": 61050,
      "end_ms": 62925,
      "text": "我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00035",
      "start_ms": 63150,
      "end_ms": 64235,
      "text": "我得提前敬一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00036",
      "start_ms": 64540,
      "end_ms": 65180,
      "text": "听这意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00037",
      "start_ms": 65180,
      "end_ms": 66220,
      "text": "领导是要高升了呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00038",
      "start_ms": 66220,
      "end_ms": 67625,
      "text": "我得提前敬领导一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00039",
      "start_ms": 67940,
      "end_ms": 69610,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00040",
      "start_ms": 69670,
      "end_ms": 70550,
      "text": "你什么意思啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00041",
      "start_ms": 70630,
      "end_ms": 72170,
      "text": "怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00042",
      "start_ms": 72170,
      "end_ms": 73370,
      "text": "领导美满美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00043",
      "start_ms": 73410,
      "end_ms": 74490,
      "text": "代表幸福美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00044",
      "start_ms": 74690,
      "end_ms": 76875,
      "text": "这一辈子美满就是一辈子美满啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00045",
      "start_ms": 77350,
      "end_ms": 79605,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00046",
      "start_ms": 80010,
      "end_ms": 81515,
      "text": "我这肚子喝茶都能胖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00047",
      "start_ms": 82490,
      "end_ms": 83750,
      "text": "领导你那不叫胖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00048",
      "start_ms": 83890,
      "end_ms": 85350,
      "text": "那叫宰相肚里能撑船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00049",
      "start_ms": 85590,
      "end_ms": 86645,
      "text": "装的全是大事儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00050",
      "start_ms": 87530,
      "end_ms": 87985,
      "text": "哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00051",
      "start_ms": 89320,
      "end_ms": 90575,
      "text": "你酒量挺好的呀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00052",
      "start_ms": 90910,
      "end_ms": 91270,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00053",
      "start_ms": 91490,
      "end_ms": 92530,
      "text": "您可抬举我了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00054",
      "start_ms": 92570,
      "end_ms": 93830,
      "text": "我平时真不太能喝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00055",
      "start_ms": 94030,
      "end_ms": 95430,
      "text": "这不今天和您在一起吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00056",
      "start_ms": 95430,
      "end_ms": 95915,
      "text": "高兴啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00057",
      "start_ms": 96070,
      "end_ms": 97785,
      "text": "这一高兴就多贪了几杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00058",
      "start_ms": 99550,
      "end_ms": 100845,
      "text": "这藕是好藕啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00059",
      "start_ms": 101380,
      "end_ms": 102625,
      "text": "就是心眼儿太多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00060",
      "start_ms": 103170,
      "end_ms": 105050,
      "text": "领导哦虽然心眼多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00061",
      "start_ms": 105350,
      "end_ms": 106625,
      "text": "但也是您的下酒菜啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00062",
      "start_ms": 107890,
      "end_ms": 109275,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00063",
      "start_ms": 109570,
      "end_ms": 110915,
      "text": "这鸭子是好鸭子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00064",
      "start_ms": 111200,
      "end_ms": 111955,
      "text": "就是嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00065",
      "start_ms": 113420,
      "end_ms": 113900,
      "text": "嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00066",
      "start_ms": 113900,
      "end_ms": 119115,
      "text": "才守得住秘密关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00067",
      "start_ms": 119440,
      "end_ms": 120980,
      "text": "每天学点高情商，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00068",
      "start_ms": 121020,
      "end_ms": 121885,
      "text": "说话技巧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f7b40bd22571fb3d_s00069",
      "start_ms": 122230,
      "end_ms": 123975,
      "text": "让你的路越走越宽。"
    }
  ],
